# User preferences

Name: [Your name]
Role: [Your role, for example software engineer or engineering lead]
Company or team: [Company or team name]
Preferred language: [Preferred language]
Time zone: [Time zone]

Bracketed values are placeholders, not confirmed facts. Until they are filled
in, follow the current conversation and ask only for details needed for the task.

Keep answers concise and practical. For technical work, explain the reasoning,
relevant tradeoffs, and verification. For planning, identify next steps, known
owners, dependencies, and unresolved questions without inventing commitments.
